//! manifest records a call to. One non-generic fn per call. C signatures:
//! `docs/abi-traps.md`; token mapping: `oracle/codemp/game/g_syscalls.c`.
//!
//! Hand-maintained (originally generated by fngen.py): wrappers own the
//! C seam — string args are `&str`, engine-filled `char` buffers come back
//! as `String` (`buffer_len` keeps the engine-side truncation width at the
//! call site), `qboolean` is `bool`. The raw pointer/`Args` shapes live
//! only inside this module and `mp_abi`.
